    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 1px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="10px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.londonsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.londonsummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Brick Lane brews
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text
      padding="0px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  The London Coffee Festival returns this weekend to The Truman Brewery on Brick Lane, celebrating the capital’s specialty coffee scene and creative culture. The event brings together more than 275 artisan coffee and gourmet food brands, offering tastings, barista demonstrations, hands-on workshops, street food, music, and expert-led masterclasses.
</p>
<p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Highlights include the global Coffee Masters competition, where top baristas showcase their skills, as well as immersive experiences such as Latte Art Live, The Roasters Village, Brew School, and The Lab. Designed for both coffee professionals and casual drinkers, the festival offers a lively deep dive into London’s coffee culture.
</p>
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  🔗 <strong>Link:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.londoncoffeefestival.com/"
  target="_blank"
>London Coffee Festival</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> May 14 - May 17<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Tickets start from £39.90<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.londoncoffeefestival.com/"
  target="_blank"
>The Truman Brewery</a>
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

